!! skins ~ mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///sense.worldline.reads

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`handler/seat spells/[[act lar:///sense.worldline.reads]] ~ the seat runs it in its own process`>>
```

